{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/UIComponentsReference"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/PlatformBehavior"],"title":"Related Documentation","anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/ServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockServiceReference"],"title":"Reference","anchor":"Reference","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The UI product layers three view modifiers on top of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatUI"},{"text":". Two primitives present the paywall and customer center directly from a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Binding<Bool>"},{"text":"; one convenience modifier composes both, driven by ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Each presentation modifier attaches to the modified content view directly — there are no ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" wrappers and no ","type":"text"},{"code":".background { … }","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" indirection. This shape is what makes the macOS sheet machinery present reliably.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For step-by-step wiring, see ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"How to Present the UI","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"},{"text":" documentation. For the rationale behind platform-specific behavior, see ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Platform Behavior","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" in the same catalog.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Library-target","text":"Library target","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Import: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":[".product(name: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI\", package: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\"),"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The UI product depends on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatUI"},{"type":"text","text":", both pulled in transitively. Apps that don’t ship paywall UI in the same target (for example, a tests-only target) can depend on the lower-level "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":" product alone."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Modifiers","anchor":"Modifiers"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"`revenueCatPaywall(isPresented:offeringIdentifier:displayCloseButton:onDismiss:)`","anchor":"revenueCatPaywallisPresentedofferingIdentifierdisplayCloseButtononDismiss"},{"code":["extension View {","    public func revenueCatPaywall(","        isPresented: Binding<Bool>,","        offeringIdentifier: String? = nil,","        displayCloseButton: Bool = true,","        onDismiss: (() -> Void)? = nil","    ) -> some View","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Attaches "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatUI.PaywallView"},{"type":"text","text":" as a platform-appropriate sheet."}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Presents in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"fullScreenCover","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so the paywall takes the full screen.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"macOS","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Presents in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"sheet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" sized to a 400×600 minimum.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass a real two-way binding; SwiftUI sets it to "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on user dismissal. Build it from "},{"code":"PaywallState.isPresented","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so the "},{"code":"set:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" closure dispatches "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".paywall(.dismiss)"},{"type":"text","text":" and the plugin clears its presentation state."}]},{"text":"Parameters","level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Parameters"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPresented"},{"type":"text","text":" — Two-way binding to the paywall’s visibility flag."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"offeringIdentifier"},{"text":" — Identifier of the RevenueCat offering to present, for a win-back or regional offer. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", which presents the dashboard’s current offering. An unknown identifier or a failed fetch falls back to the current offering with a logged warning.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"displayCloseButton"},{"type":"text","text":" — Whether "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallView"},{"type":"text","text":" shows a close button. Defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":". Neither the iOS "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fullScreenCover"},{"type":"text","text":" nor the macOS "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sheet"},{"type":"text","text":" offers any other dismissal affordance, so pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" only for a hard paywall the user must purchase through."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" — Optional callback fired after dismissal."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"`revenueCatCustomerCenter(isPresented:onDismiss:)`","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"revenueCatCustomerCenterisPresentedonDismiss"},{"code":["extension View {","    public func revenueCatCustomerCenter(","        isPresented: Binding<Bool>,","        onDismiss: (() -> Void)? = nil","    ) -> some View","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Attaches the customer center as a platform-appropriate sheet."}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Presents "},{"code":"RevenueCatUI.CustomerCenterView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in a "},{"code":"sheet","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"macOS","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Opens "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"itms-apps:\/\/apps.apple.com\/account\/subscriptions"},{"type":"text","text":" via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSWorkspace.shared.open"},{"type":"text","text":" (falling back to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/apps.apple.com\/account\/subscriptions"},{"type":"text","text":" web URL if nothing on the system handles the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"itms-apps"},{"type":"text","text":" scheme), immediately clears the binding, and fires "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":". RevenueCatUI does not ship a customer center on macOS."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":4,"anchor":"Parameters","type":"heading","text":"Parameters"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"isPresented","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — Two-way binding to the customer center’s visibility flag.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" — Optional callback fired after dismissal (or, on macOS, after the App Store URL is opened)."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"revenueCatPaywallstateofferingIdentifierdisplayCloseButtonsend","text":"`revenueCatPaywall(state:offeringIdentifier:displayCloseButton:send:)`"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["extension View {","    public func revenueCatPaywall(","        state: PaywallState,","        offeringIdentifier: String? = nil,","        displayCloseButton: Bool = true,","        send: @escaping (PaywallAction) -> Void","    ) -> some View","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Convenience modifier that attaches both "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywall(isPresented:offeringIdentifier:displayCloseButton:onDismiss:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatCustomerCenter(isPresented:onDismiss:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and dispatches the matching dismiss action when each sheet closes."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The two presentations are mutually exclusive; the paywall wins. While ","type":"text"},{"code":"state.isPresented","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the customer-center binding reads ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and a request for either surface while the other is up dispatches ","type":"text"},{"code":".dismissCustomerCenter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" never holds a flag for a surface that isn’t showing. After a restore inside the paywall, the modifier also dispatches ","type":"text"},{"code":".dismiss","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" once ","type":"text"},{"code":"state.isGateSatisfied","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", because RevenueCatUI does not dismiss after a restore. See ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Platform Behavior"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" documentation.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":4,"anchor":"Parameters","text":"Parameters"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state"},{"type":"text","text":" — The paywall slice from your store, typically "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store.paywall"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"offeringIdentifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — Identifier of the RevenueCat offering to present. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (the dashboard’s current offering); see the primitive modifier above.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"displayCloseButton"},{"type":"text","text":" — Whether "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallView"},{"type":"text","text":" shows a close button. Defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":"; see the primitive modifier above."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"send","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — A closure that lifts a "},{"code":"PaywallAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" into your root action and dispatches it through the store. Typically "},{"code":"{ store.send(.paywall($0)) }","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","level":4,"anchor":"Manual-wiring","text":"Manual wiring"},{"code":["ContentView()","    .revenueCatPaywall(","        isPresented: Binding(","            get: { store.paywall.isPresented },","            set: { if !$0 { store.send(.paywall(.dismiss)) } }","        )","    )","    .revenueCatCustomerCenter(","        isPresented: Binding(","            get: { store.paywall.isCustomerCenterPresented },","            set: { if !$0 { store.send(.paywall(.dismissCustomerCenter)) } }","        )","    )"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This attaches the same two sheets but without the exclusivity and close-after-restore rules above, which you then own. Use the convenience modifier when both sheets are needed; use the primitives when only one is needed or when you want to interleave other modifiers between them."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"API reference for the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatCustomerCenter"},{"type":"text","text":" view modifiers — the SwiftUI surface of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/uicomponentsreference"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"UI Components Reference","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}],"role":"article"},"kind":"article","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"]]},"references":{"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/PlatformBehavior":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Why the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"r